{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Channel your 4 corners and start aiming \u2014 it's time to fight!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Squares is a fast-paced, online 2D shooter with 8-directional chaos and colorful, corner-fueled mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your square:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose your weapons</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pick your color</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Square up with your own custom shape</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Tumble. Bounce. Recoil. DOMINATE.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine 2 unique classes, each tailored to different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your class isn't just a loadout \u2014 it's your style, your skill, your statement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crave raw power and explosive destruction? Grenade. Rocket Launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need speed and a thirst for chaos? Charge. Shotgun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to fly and wreak havoc mid-air? Mini-gun. Revolver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All about precision and proving it's not a skill issue? Revolver. Sniper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match classes to find the combo that fits your twisted, square-shaped soul. <br>Discover your perfect setup, and shatter the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One arena. Infinite combos. Zero mercy. <br>Are you the square to rule them all?</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3180450?t=1762016274","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762016274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180450/7f0de4154781a599b47d1c3e80f15e4233053702/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762016274","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180450/7f0de4154781a599b47d1c3e80f15e4233053702/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762016274","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Channel your 4 corners and start aiming \u2014 it's time to fight!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Squares is a fast-paced, online 2D shooter with 8-directional chaos and colorful, corner-fueled mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your square:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose your weapons</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pick your color</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Square up with your own custom shape</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Tumble. Bounce. Recoil. DOMINATE.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine 2 unique classes, each tailored to different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your class isn't just a loadout \u2014 it's your style, your skill, your statement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crave raw power and explosive destruction? Grenade. Rocket Launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need speed and a thirst for chaos? Charge. Shotgun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to fly and wreak havoc mid-air? Mini-gun. Revolver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All about precision and proving it's not a skill issue? Revolver. Sniper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match classes to find the combo that fits your twisted, square-shaped soul. <br>Discover your perfect setup, and shatter the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One arena. Infinite combos. Zero mercy. <br>Are you the square to rule them all?</p>","developers":["Feesh S